      "content": "Okay, that sounds manageable. I'm particularly worried about any signals that might look like rhythmic or heart-rate irregularities, as regulators have been hypersensitive to that lately. Did you see anything in the latest batch of raw data regarding cardiac rhythm or any correlation with arrhythmias that we should be aware of before I sign off on this summary?",
